@api = https://localhost:7119

### 1. Create a redemption (2000 points)
# @name create
POST {{api}}/redemptions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "C-100", "lines": [ { "rewardSku": "CAP-01", "quantity": 2 }, { "rewardSku": "BOTTLE-01", "quantity": 1 } ] }

### 2. Delivery pending -> PointsReserved
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/delivery-status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Pending" }

### 3. Reserved points: 2000
GET {{api}}/customers/C-100/reserved-points

### 4. Delivery held -> CommitPending, then the adapter confirms -> PointsCommitted
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/delivery-status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Held" }

### 5. Wait 2-3 seconds: status should be PointsCommitted
GET {{api}}/redemptions/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Reserved points: 0 (settled)
GET {{api}}/customers/C-100/reserved-points

### 7. On delivery
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/delivery-status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "OnDelivery" }

### 8. Partial delivery -> ReversalPending, then the adapter confirms -> PartiallyCompleted
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/delivery-status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CompletedPartially", "delivered": [ { "rewardSku": "CAP-01", "deliveredQuantity": 2 }, { "rewardSku": "BOTTLE-01", "deliveredQuantity": 0 } ] }

### 9. Wait 2-3 seconds: status PartiallyCompleted with full history
GET {{api}}/redemptions/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### 10. Idempotency: send the same message twice (same messageId)
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/delivery-status?messageId=dup-test-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Completed" }

### 11. Run this one again with the SAME messageId: the orchestrator logs "Duplicate message ... ignored"
POST {{api}}/dev/redemptions/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/delivery-status?messageId=dup-test-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Completed" }

### 12. Dead-letter queue: step 10 was invalid (redemption already finished) -> InvalidTransition
GET {{api}}/dev/dead-letters